	"FriendlyName": "Sprite Optimizer",
	"Description": "Sprite Optimizer is a professional Unreal Engine plugin designed for advanced Paper2D sprite optimization and atlas creation. It automatically removes transparent areas from sprites, creates optimized textures, and combines multiple sprites into efficient texture atlases with intelligent packing algorithms to significantly reduce memory usage and improve rendering performance.",
